  "notes": [
    "All six native capture processes closed with exit 0 before their observations were compressed.",
    "The first threshold wrapper invocation was rejected with exit 2 before Rhino launched because exec was omitted; its raw local log was overwritten by the corrected invocation. This is a reconstructed note, not a retained native failure.",
    "Kernel/UI/check tests are headless. Native means usd-brep/SMLib backend in local replays; native captures use licensed Rhino in private Xvfb.",
    "Exact ruled images and complete edge/vertex incidence use strict 1e-9 gates. New families do not claim matching U coordinates.",
    "The original nine untracked files were checksum verified and AGENTS.md was left unchanged."
